<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>页面未找到｜众测雷达</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/branding/ai-radar-logo-20260815.png">
<style>
:root { color-scheme: dark; --bg:#05080a; --panel:#0a100a; --text:#d5eadb; --muted:#79a184; --accent:#00e5ff; --good:#39ff14; --line:#1d3424; }
* { box-sizing:border-box; }
body { min-height:100vh; display:grid; place-items:center; margin:0; padding:24px; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font:16px/1.7 ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Consolas,monospace; }
main { width:min(620px,100%); padding:40px; background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; }
.code { color:var(--good); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:.12em; }
h1 { margin:10px 0 14px; font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,50px); line-height:1.15; }
p { color:var(--muted); }
a { display:inline-block; margin-top:12px; color:var(--accent); text-underline-offset:3px; }
</style>
</head>
<body><main><div class="code">HTTP 404</div><h1>这里没有雷达回波</h1><p>你访问的页面不存在，或链接已经失效。实时榜单和评测说明仍可从首页进入。</p><a href="/">← 返回众测雷达首页</a></main></body>
</html>
